https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639176415805036172-2106261226202620.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 2 BHK Apartment at Dimples 73 East, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639176415808194497-2106261226202620.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Building Lobby in 2 BHK Apartment at Dimples 73 East, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639176415811108208-2106261226212621.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206841, 72.832965*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206841, 72.832965](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 3.16 Cr**\n\nSecure a new home in Kandivali West, Mumbai, within the Dimples 73 East project, featuring an unfurnished 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom Flats.This property is less than a year old, offering a fresh start with modern construction.The 818 square feet of living space provide ample room for comfortable accommodation and personalization.While there is no dedicated parking, the focus is on the interior living\n\n![4 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dimples 73 East, Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639233244924173750-260826070132417.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 4 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 4 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206841, 72.832965*\n\n![Location map of 4 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206841, 72.832965](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 6.5 Cr**\n\nThis spacious 4 bedroom, 5 bathroom Flats in Kandivali West, Mumbai presents a fantastic buying opportunity with its generous 1636 square feet of living space. Located on the 39th floor of the prestigious Dimples 73 East project, this unfurnished residence offers stunning community views and boasts an impressive array of amenities designed for modern living, including a gymnasium, swimming pool, kids`\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dimples 73 East, Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639119739826981028-160426100622622.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 2 BHK Apartment at Dimples 73 East, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639119739824325447-160426100622622.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 2 BHK Apartment at Dimples 73 East, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639119739829492005-160426100622622.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206841, 72.832965*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206841, 72.832965](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 2.75 Cr**\n\nDiscover a brand-new, unfurnished two-bedroom, two-bathroom Flats in Kandivali West, Mumbai, available for sale at 2.75 crore. This spacious 836 Square Feet residence within the Dimples 73 East project offers the perfect canvas for you to create your dream home.With one dedicated parking space, this property is ideal for individuals or small families looking to settle in a growing urban area.Its\n\n![AVIK HOME  profile picture](https://img.squareyards.com/connect/profilepic/918369811714639069494043184170.jpg?aio=w-32;h-32;crop;)\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in Dimples 73 East, Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639197305406262890-1507260442204220.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206841, 72.832965*\n\n![Location map of 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206841, 72.832965](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 2.86 Cr**\n\nThis unfurnished 2-bedroom, 3-bathroom Flats in Dimples 73 East, Kandivali West, Mumbai, is listed for sale at 2.86 crore. Spanning 818 square feet, this property is less than a year old and offers a wealth of amenities designed for a convenient and enjoyable lifestyle.Residents can take advantage of a gymnasium, swimming pool, and a dedicated kids` play area, alongside a soothing\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608921322044-090526100132132.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608894369151-090526100129129.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608896844437-090526100129129.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608899578335-090526100129129.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Balcony in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608902153183-090526100130130.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608904879001-090526100130130.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Kitchen in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608907410921-090526100130130.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608909924960-090526100130130.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/optImages/IN_639139608912878382-090526100131131.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 1 BHK Apartment at Kandivali West –