i Castalia Kandivali, Kandivali West](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/IN_638963395353539344-1710251112151215.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Bathroom in 3 BHK Apartment at Hiranandani Castalia Kandivali, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/IN_638963395367925840-1710251112161216.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n![Room in 3 BHK Apartment at Hiranandani Castalia Kandivali, Kandivali West – for Sale](https://img.squareyards.com/secondaryPortal/IN_638963395368377728-1710251112161216.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\n## 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai *Location map of 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206313, 72.834163*\n\n![Location map of 3 BHK Flat for Sale in Kandivali West, Mumbai located at 19.206313, 72.834163](/assets/images/map-icon.png)\n\n**₹ 4.5 Cr**\n\nA 1024 square feet, three-bedroom, three-bathroom unfurnished Flats is available for sale in Hiranandani Castalia Kandivali, Mumbai for 4.5 crore.This Vastu compliant residence offers a lifestyle filled with modern amenities including a gymnasium, swimming pool, badminton court, tennis court, squash court, kids' play areas, jogging and cycle track, power backup, and 24x7 security, all within a well-integrated clubhouse complex. Residents\n\nPersonalized home recommendations based on your lifestyle, location, and budget.\n\n![Smarter home match recommendation preview](/assets/images/recommandation-images/recommendation-preview.png)\n![Personalized home matching](/assets/images/recommandation-images/icon-star.svg)\n\nRecommendations tailored to your real needs.\n\n![Smarter locality suggestions](/assets/images/recommandation-images/pin-icon.svg)\n\nDiscover neighborhoods that fit your lifestyle.\n\n![Budget aware recommendations](/assets/images/recommandation-images/wallet-icon.svg)\n\nFind homes that match your budget.\n\n![Personalized property recommendation cards](/assets/images/recommandation-images/property-img.png)\n![voice search]()![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/rna-regency-park/27593/project","title":"RNA Regency Park, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price on Request","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![RNA Corp developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rna-corp-597.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# RNA Regency Park Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![RNA Regency Park Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rna-regency-park-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![RNA Regency Park Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rna-regency-park-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![RNA Regency Park Entrance View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rna-regency-park-project-entrance-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹20,327 Per Sq. Ft Onwards**\n\n₹20,327 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## About RNA Regency Park, Kandivali West by RNA Corp\n\n## RNA Regency Park Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for RNA Regency Park.\n\n| Unit Type (Saleable) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  450 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  1040 Sq. Ft. | **Price on Request** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for RNA Regency Park.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nA total of 7 residential transactions has been registered so far for RNA Regency Park, amounting to ₹ 10 Cr till August 2026.\n\nRent in RNA Regency Park ranges from ₹ 38 K to ₹ 58 K with options available for 1 BHK, 2 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for RNA Regency Park moved from ₹ 27,650/sqft to ₹ 28,800/sqft, reflecting a 4.16% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for RNA Regency Park moved from ₹ 27,250/sqft to ₹ 27,650/sqft, reflecting a 1.47% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for RNA Regency Park moved from ₹ 25,100/sqft to ₹ 27,250/sqft, reflecting a 8.57% rise.\n\n## RNA Regency Park Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 1 BHK 450 Sq. Ft. Apartment in RNA Regency Park, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 2 BHK 1040 Sq. Ft. Apartment in RNA Regency Park, Mumbai](/assets/images/floor-plans-coming-soon.svg)\n\nPrice:Price on Request\n\n## Resale & Rental Listings in RNA Regency Park\n\nExplore resale and rental listings currently available in RNA Regency Park, Mumbai.\n\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in RNA Regency Park in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![1 BHK Apartment For Sale in RNA Regency Park in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Sale in RNA Regency Park in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Maa sheetala properties  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK + Pooja Room Apartment For Sale in RNA Regency Park in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![2 BHK +Apartment For Rent in RNA Regency Park in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![ASHISH  profile picture]()\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in RNA Regency Park in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Rakesh Kumar Pal]()\n\nMumbai\n\nJai Mataji Property\n\n![Sunil Ransure]()\n\nClassic Property\n\n![Manoj Mahendra Pal]()\n\nGlobal Housing\n\n![Ghrihum Real Estate]()\n\nGrihum Properties\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of RNA Regency Park\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of RNA Regency Park to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![RNA Regency Park Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rna-regency-park-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![RNA Regency Park Entrance View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/rna-regency-park-project-entrance-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n## Amenities & Specifications of RNA Regency Park\n\n### Sports Sports\n\n![Sports](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/sports/am-ico-gymnasiu-active.svg)\n\n### Convenience Convenience\n\n![Convenience](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/convenience/am-ico-powerbac-active.svg)\n\n### Safety Safety\n\n![Safety](https://static.squareyards.com/assets/images/svg/amenities/safety/am-ico-24x7secu-active.svg)\n\n### Leisure Leisure\n\n![Leisure](https://static.squareyar