rji Pallonji Sarova\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n![Shapoorji Pallonji Siennaa Wing A project in Kandivali East, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-shapoorji-pallonji-siennaa-wing-a-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-229;h-150;crop;)\n\n### [Shapoorji Pallonji Siennaa Wing A](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-siennaa-wing-a/100420/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Siennaa Wing A\")\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\nSend one enquiry to all selected projects and compare up to 4 options side-by-side.\n\n## RNA Corp Track Record\n\n![RNA Corp logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/rna-corp-597.jpg?aio=w-300;h-300;fill;)\n\nRNA Corp Developers is a leading real estate organization that was earlier called RNA Builders. The company is one of the leading names in the Indian real estate market. RNA Corp Builders possesses more than three decades of experience in the industry and has served innumerable customers and corporate entities over the years. The tally of RNA Corp projects includes offerings in both residential and commercial segments. The portfolio of RNA Corp properties encompasses a whopping 10 million sq. ft. of completed development across the Mumbai Metropolitan Region over the last decade. The company is also in the process of developing several other landmark projects in the area. Mixed-used real estate is another specialty of the company. Why RNA Corp? All RNA Corp residential projects are built with a keen eye on overall quality, budget and timelines. The company delivers projects on time to customers and believes in creating greater value for customers at all times. The company adheres to stringent quality standards and maintains high customer relationship standards. One of the biggest strengths of the company is its ability to adapt and evolve as per changing market dynamics. Customer experience is a major focus area for the company and it aims at delivering superior customer service. Proper construction management and innovation remain key strengths of the company along with a skilled team of employees who helm projects. The company makes use of the best materials for construction along with the latest technologies. The company has its own cutting edge quality management system for measuring progress. The company works on a philosophy of continual quality enhancement. The company offers fun and engaging designs at its projects that fuse functionality and aesthetics with aplomb. Major Projects There are several landmarks built by the company over the years and the list also includes several RNA Corp upcoming projects. Here’s taking a look at some of them: RNA Address- This premium project is located at Santacruz West and offers high end lifestyles to residents. The project stands out for its architectural magnificence and premium amenities alike. The project is well connected to the Bandra-Kurla Complex and comes with automated basement parking for a thousand cars, huge open spaces, a huge recreational zone with a podium, landscaped garden, jogging track and air conditioned entrance lobby among other features. There are separate swimming pools for both children and adults RNA Exotica- This landmark project also boasts of awe inspiring architecture and comes with ten podium parking levels in addition to 30 floors of living space. The project is located at Goregaon West and has a double height air conditioned lobby in addition to features like a swimming pool, landscaped garden, cutting edge gymnasium, Jacuzzi and squash courts among othersRNA Palazzo- Located at Kandivali, this project offers amazing views and larger than life designs. From the latest security technologies and a premium club house to state of the art amenities and luxurious fittings and finishes, this project offers unmatched lifestyles to residents\n\n![RNA at 4th residential project in Chembur](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rna-at-4th-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nChembur, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![RNA 360 residential project in Worli](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rna-360-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nWorli, Mumbai\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![RNA Corp Jayalaxmi residential project in Chembur](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rna-corp-jayalaxmi-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nChembur, Mumbai\n\nStudio\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![RNA Corporate Park residential project in Bandra East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rna-corporate-park-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBandra East, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Mrug Vihar CHS residential project in Subhash Nagar](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-mrug-vihar-chs-project-flagship.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSubhash Nagar, Mumbai\n\nStudio\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![RNA Complex residential project in Santacruz East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rna-complex-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSantacruz East, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![RNA Jolly Apartment residential project in Santacruz West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rna-jolly-apartment-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSantacruz West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![RNA Sunderbans residential project in Santacruz West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rna-sunderbans-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nSantacruz West, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![RNA Legend residential project in Goregaon West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/